{"sentences":[{"id":"s_work_cdt_135_1","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_135","textTraditional":"一、三年，春王正月，公會晉侯、宋公、衞侯、曹伯伐鄭。","sentenceOrder":1},{"id":"s_work_cdt_135_2","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_135","textTraditional":"二、辛亥，葬衞繆公。","sentenceOrder":2},{"id":"s_work_cdt_135_3","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_135","textTraditional":"三、二月，公至自伐鄭。","sentenceOrder":3},{"id":"s_work_cdt_135_4","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_135","textTraditional":"四、甲子，新宮災。三日哭。","sentenceOrder":4},{"id":"s_work_cdt_135_5","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_135","textTraditional":"新宮者何？宣公之宮也。宣宮則曷為謂之新宮？不忍言也。其言三日哭何？廟災三日哭，禮也。新宮災何以書？記災也。","sentenceOrder":5},{"id":"s_work_cdt_135_6","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_135","textTraditional":"五、乙亥，葬宋文公。","sentenceOrder":6},{"id":"s_work_cdt_135_7","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_135","textTraditional":"六、夏，公如晉。","sentenceOrder":7},{"id":"s_work_cdt_135_8","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_135","textTraditional":"七、鄭公子去疾率師伐許。","sentenceOrder":8},{"id":"s_work_cdt_135_9","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_135","textTraditional":"八、公至自晉。","sentenceOrder":9},{"id":"s_work_cdt_135_10","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_135","textTraditional":"九、秋，叔孫僑如率師圍棘。","sentenceOrder":10},{"id":"s_work_cdt_135_11","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_135","textTraditional":"棘者何？汶陽之不服邑也。其言圍之何？不聽也。","sentenceOrder":11},{"id":"s_work_cdt_135_12","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_135","textTraditional":"十、晉郤克、衞孫良夫伐將咎如。","sentenceOrder":12},{"id":"s_work_cdt_135_13","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_135","textTraditional":"十一、冬十有一月，晉侯使荀庚來聘。","sentenceOrder":13},{"id":"s_work_cdt_135_14","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_135","textTraditional":"十二、衞侯使孫良夫來聘。","sentenceOrder":14},{"id":"s_work_cdt_135_15","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_135","textTraditional":"十三、丙午，及荀庚盟。","sentenceOrder":15},{"id":"s_work_cdt_135_16","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_135","textTraditional":"十四、丁未，及孫良夫盟。","sentenceOrder":16},{"id":"s_work_cdt_135_17","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_135","textTraditional":"此聘也，其言盟何？聘而言盟者，尋舊盟也。","sentenceOrder":17},{"id":"s_work_cdt_135_18","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_135","textTraditional":"十五、鄭伐許。","sentenceOrder":18}],"overrides":{}}